        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''# Shopify Developer Resources

A curated list of essential Shopify resources for Shopify app developers.

---

## 🚀 App Development

- **Decode Products Organizer (Shopify App Store)**  
  https://apps.shopify.com/decode-products-organizer

- **Shopify Partner Dashboard (Submit Your App)**  
  https://partners.shopify.com/

- **Shopify App Development Docs**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps

- **App Review Guidelines**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/store/review

- **Shopify CLI**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/tools/cli

---

## 🧩 APIs & SDKs

- **Admin API (REST & GraphQL)**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin

- **Storefront API**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/storefront

- **Partner API**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/partner

- **Webhooks**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/webhooks

- **App Bridge**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/tools/app-bridge

- **Polaris (Shopify Design System)**  
  https://polaris.shopify.com/

---

## 🛠️ Extensions & Advanced Features

- **Checkout UI Extensions**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/checkout

- **Admin UI Extensions**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/admin

- **Theme App Extensions**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/online-store/theme-app-extensions

- **Shopify Functions**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/functions

- **Hydrogen (Headless Framework)**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/custom-storefronts/hydrogen

---

## 💳 Billing & Monetization

- **App Billing API**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/billing

- **Revenue Share Information**  
  https://www.shopify.com/partners/blog/app-revenue

---

## 🔐 Authentication & Security

- **OAuth Guide**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/auth/oauth

- **Session Tokens**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/auth/session-tokens

- **Security Best Practices**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/store/security

---

## 📈 Growth & Marketing

- **App Store Optimization (ASO)**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/store/optimization

- **Shopify Community**  
  https://community.shopify.com/

- **Developer Changelog**  
  https://shopify.dev/changelog

---

## 🧪 Testing & Development Stores

- **Create Development Store**  
  https://partners.shopify.com/

- **Testing Guide**  
  https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/test'''
        key: unique_3
        props:
